  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Vandalism and Theft:</strong> Open trailers often transport several bikes side by side, making them more vulnerable to vandalism and theft.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Uncertain Timing:</strong> The flexibility in scheduling can lead to delays, which may cause inconvenience for the bike parcel recipients.</span></li>
</ul>

<h3>Comparing Key Services:</h3>

<p>When considering the pros and cons of enclosed carriers versus open trailers, it is essential to evaluate the key services offered in Surajpur Mau:</p>

